{"sequence":196,"id":"wx-46e037783963bbf9","timestamp":"2026-08-01T00:22:23+08:00","sender":"Kevin 汉堡 🍔","side":"left","messageType":"文本","text":"Windows 可以用这个CMD脚本启动dsh（也可以加到环境变量）\n```bat\n@echo off\n\nset DSH_ROOT=C:\\Tools\\目录地址\nset DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=密钥\nset NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY=1\nset TSX_TSCONFIG_PATH=tsconfig.json\n\npnpm --dir \"%DSH_ROOT%\"  exec node --import tsx/esm \"apps\\cli\\src\\bin.ts\" %*\n```","redacted":false}
